<p>
With the onset of warm weather, Kurt operated the irrigation on the willow cuttings and newly planted herbaceous plugs.  While the irrigation ran, Kurt used a disk to repair the rutted access road, collected seed from lens sedge (<i>Carex lenticularis</i>) and cleaned up the site.
